==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|плита}}, {{m|orv|плифа}}, {{m|orv|пленьфа}}, {{m|orv|плинта}}, a borrowing from {{der|ru|grc|πλίνθος|g=f}}, with original reference to a four-sided stone ground in an {{w|lang=ru|Русское деревянное зодчество|ordinary Russian house}} set up as a fire-place; compare {{cog|la|tēgula}} and {{cog|de|Kachel}} for the semantic development. {{doublet|ru|пли́нтус|пли́нфа}}.

